@startuml
!theme plain
autonumber

participant "Temporal Server\n(History & Event Store)" as Server
participant "Temporal Worker\n(Go Process)" as Worker
database "MySQL" as DB
actor "Pasien" as Patient

== 1. Kondisi Normal Sebelum Gangguan ==
Server -> Worker : WorkflowTaskScheduled (ActivityPlanWorkflow)
Worker -> Worker : Inisialisasi state, baca jadwal
Worker -> Server : workflow.NewTimer(duration)
note right of Server: Server mencatat TimerStartedEvent di Event History.\nStatus workflow aman di server.

== 2. Skenario Gangguan: Worker Mengalami Crash / Dimatikan ==
Worker -> Worker : [CRASH / KILLED (SIGKILL / Docker Stop)]
note over Worker: Worker OFF / Mati total!\nTidak ada proses berjalan di worker container.

note over Server: Timer tetap berjalan secara mandiri di Temporal Server.\nWaktu pengingat tercapai saat Worker masih mati.\nServer membuat Task: TimerFiredEvent & menaruhnya di Task Queue.

== 3. Pemulihan: Worker Dijalankan Kembali (Self-Healing) ==
Worker -> Worker : [Worker Restarted / Docker Start]
Worker -> Server : PollWorkflowTaskQueue('activity-plan-queue')
Server -> Worker : Deliver History (Semua event sebelumnya + TimerFired)

Worker -> Worker : REPLAY HISTORY secara deterministik:
note over Worker: Workflow melanjutkan eksekusi tepat di baris\nsetelah Timer selesai tanpa mengulang langkah sebelumnya!

== 4. Kelanjutan Alur Tanpa Kehilangan State ==
Worker -> Server : ScheduleActivity('SendActivityReminderActivity')
Server -> Worker : ExecuteActivity
Worker -> DB : POST /api/internal/schedules/{id}/reminder-sent
DB --> Worker : 200 OK (Reminder Log Saved)
Worker -> Server : CompleteActivity

Worker -> Server : WaitSignal or WaitTimer (Window Laporan Pasien)
Patient -> DB : Kirim Laporan via Mobile App
DB -> Server : Signal 'patient-reported-signal'
Server -> Worker : Deliver Signal into workflow
Worker -> Worker : Catat laporan, lanjutkan ke jadwal berikutnya!
@enduml
